<!-- ===== APPROACH — step list ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="eyebrow.approach">Our approach</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Discover &rarr; Develop &rarr; Produce &rarr; Amplify.">Discover &rarr; Develop &rarr; Produce &rarr; Amplify.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Empat langkah yang sama pada setiap projek — sama ada podcast langsung bulanan atau penggambaran produk satu hari.">The same four steps on every project — whether it's a monthly live podcast or a one-day product shoot.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="step-list step-list--4" style="margin-top:2.8rem">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Terokai">Discover</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kami bermula dengan objektif perniagaan, audiens dan konteks jenama anda — bukan dengan moodboard.">We start with your business objective, audience and brand context — not with a moodboard.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Bangunkan">Develop</h3>
        <p data-bm="Arah kreatif, konsep dan pelan pelaksanaan yang menghubungkan idea dengan hasil yang boleh diukur.">Creative direction, concepts and a delivery plan that connect the idea to a measurable outcome.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Hasilkan">Produce</h3>
        <p data-bm="Penggambaran, acara langsung, penyuntingan dan pasca-produksi dijalankan oleh pasukan yang sama.">Shoots, live events, editing and post-production handled by the same in-house team.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Perkasakan">Amplify</h3>
        <p data-bm="Pengagihan merentasi sosial, DOOH dan media berbayar — dengan penjejakan prestasi dan pelaporan.">Distribution across social, DOOH and paid media — with performance tracking and reporting.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

